}=1\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}y=\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nWe now write our integral in terms of $u,$ calculate the integral as normal, and write the final answer in terms of $u$ at the very end:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (y+11)^{5/3}\\,\\text{d}y & =\\int {u}^{5/3}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{{u}^{8/3}}{8/3}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{8}(y+11)^{8/3}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{8}\\sqrt[3]{(y+11)^{8}}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's double-check that our result is correct. If we differentiate the result, then it should come out to the original integrand:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}y}[\\frac{3}{8}\\sqrt[3]{(y+11)^{8}}] & =\\frac{3}{8}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}y}[\\sqrt[3]{(y+11)^{8}}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}y}(C) \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{8}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}y}[(y+11)^{8/3}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}y}(C) \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{8}\\cdot \\frac{8}{3}(y+11)^{5/3}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}y}(y+11)+0 \\\\  & =(y+11)^{5/3}\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =\\sqrt[3]{(y+11)^{5}}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533933 true] [17592186266933 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266934 13194139533933 true] [17592186266933 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266935 13194139533933 true] [17592186266933 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266936 13194139533933 true] [17592186266933 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266937 13194139533933 true] [17592186266933 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266938 13194139533933 true] [17592186266933 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533933 true] [17592186266933 1041 "selection" 13194139533933 true] [17592186266933 1104 #edb/ref 17592186266934 13194139533933 true] [17592186266933 1110 #uuid "a7619ece-38ea-59d2-a313-65f7b590f0ee" 13194139533933 true] [17592186266934 1034 "\\frac{3}{8}\\sqrt[3]{(y+11)^{8}}+C" 13194139533933 true] [17592186266934 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533933 true] [17592186266934 1111 #uuid "69ef12d7-402a-50fb-b096-c48bd22ccc9a" 13194139533933 true] [17592186266935 1034 "\\frac{8}{3}\\sqrt[3]{(y+11)^{2}}+C" 13194139533933 true] [17592186266935 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 131941